  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country Programme Framework Dominican Republic for inclusive and sustainable industrial development 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective of this Country Programme Framework is to support the Government of the Dominican Republic in achieving its goals to accelerate economic growth as outlined in the National Development Strategy 2030. Through the Country Programme Framework, UNIDO will deliver its resources in an integrated manner, leveraging its comparative advantages to align with the Dominican Republic#s industrial objectives and targets. UNIDO will accomplish this by implementing its technical cooperation function and particularly by focusing on its capacity to assist the Government at the policy, normative, and convening levels. Under the Government&apos;s leadership and ownership, all relevant parties # national and international stakeholders # will collaborate in a multi-stakeholder partnership to mobilize the necessary resources and execute technical activities, ensuring full alignment with national industrial priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
